   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Candy gloss: median ~134, glossy clean highlights (228,221,218), magenta and blue accents (hue bins 7 and 11 at 17-18%), porcelain-pink skin (hue 20), medium-low saturation (0.23). Best for: High-fashion bridal portraits, pink/lilac/blue decor, modern venues with neon or coloured light, creative couple editorials. Pushes colours away from natural - use on stylised frames.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
